data: {"id": "e0df4c2e55b546d5-thinking-parallel_evidence-947", "run_id": "e0df4c2e55b546d5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "基于已采集的工具结果，对 `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` 的调查事实如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与状态\n*   **Pod ID**: `workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` (Namespace: `aiops-case-10`, UID: `b1c01c93-0091-4506-bcbd-69cfd75e0f12`)\n*   **所属节点**: `node2` (IP: 10.2.0.50)\n*   **当前状态**: **CrashLoopBackOff** (非正常运行)。容器 `app` 处于循环重启状态，最近一次重启约 44s 前。\n*   **控制器**: ReplicaSet `workload-79d9f8fd88`。\n*   **容器镜像**: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，命令为 `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`。\n\n### 2. 支持 \"CurrentStateVerification ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788469938548, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

